{"id":"4972","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4972_main_22-halo_photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这幅极端广角照片拍摄于南极洲，显示了在月球周围形成的22°光晕，这是因月光与卷云和卷层云中的冰晶相互作用而形成的。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Tatsuru Fujita","location":"南极洲昭和站","latitude":"纬度: 69° 0' 15'' S","longitude":"经度: 39° 34' 45'' E","date":"12 April 2012 0442 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"","code":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.13.1.1"}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4136_main_cirrostratus-nebulosus-and-22-halo_clouds-photometeors.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>照片显示了从西方入侵的一层薄薄的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">卷层云</span>云巾（照片右侧）。缺乏形态或细节将其确定为雾状云种。还可以看到少量的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高积云</span>。主要特征是完全中等强度的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">22°太阳光晕</span>，这是由太阳光线穿过许多随机排列的冰晶引起的。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Frank Le Blancq","location":"泽西圣旺","latitude":"纬度: 49° 13' 45'' N","longitude":"经度: 2° 13' 33'' W","date":"29 March 2016 1300 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 3, CH= 6","code":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.1","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.13.1.1"}]}]}